## Dataset Information

### 1. MH-Weed16 Dataset

MH-Weed16 is an Indian multiclass annotated weed dataset collected from real agricultural fields in Maharashtra, India. It contains RGB and RGB-D images of soybean crop and weed species under natural field conditions.

- Total images: 25,972
- Weed classes: 16
- Annotated field images: 6,656
- Crop context: soybean with weeds
- Region: Pune and Sangli, Maharashtra, India
- Data type: RGB, RGB-D
- Annotation formats: Pascal VOC, YOLO TXT, JSON

Dataset link: https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/d3n3mgjjbv/2

Reference: MH-Weed16 is described as a real-field Indian weed dataset with 25,972 images and 16 weed species. 0

### 2. Jute Weed Dataset from West Bengal

I am also preparing a jute-field weed image dataset collected from Sabang, Paschim Medinipur, West Bengal, India. The dataset contains weed images captured under real jute-field conditions.

- Crop context: jute fields
- Location: Sabang, Paschim Medinipur, West Bengal, India
- Device: Samsung Galaxy S21 FE
- Image types:
  - High-resolution still images: 6936 × 9248 pixels
  - Video-frame images: 1080 × 1920 pixels
- Imaging setup: top-down view, approximately 90° camera angle
- Current class labels include: bagua flower, bajaj, chakra, chakra2, chakra3, chhatapeti, geema, jol susni, kajol, kansira, lal shyama, paddy plant, sada shyama, seddho grass, shol

This dataset is currently under cleaning, polishing, annotation checking, and research preparation. A sample CSV file and a few sample images are provided only for demonstration. The complete dataset will be released later after proper curation and publication.
